<title>MOROCCO: China to build nuclear plant in Morocco.</title>
<headline>China to build nuclear plant in Morocco.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>China is considering building a nuclear plant in Morocco for removing salt from sea water and a factory for manufacturing phosphoric fertilisers, an embassy spokesman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The spokesman said a feasibility study commissioned by Morocco and the International Atomic Energy Agency was under way for the plant, expected to be sited in the southern part of the North African country.</p>
<p>He gave no further details.</p>
<p>The projects are the result of talks between visiting Chinese State Councillor Song Jian and Moroccan officials.</p>
</text>
